; ==============================================================================
;  classic-demo  -  test theme for config\module-map.rc
;  Names its module the way a 2002 theme does. Nothing here loads Label.dll by
;  name: litestep maps label-1.99 to Label through *ModuleAlias. Copy this folder
;  to <run folder>\themes\classic-demo, select it with tools\switch-theme.ps1 and
;  check that Label.dll is loaded and the box below shows up.
;  Core is loaded by its own name: every nModule needs it ("There was a problem
;  connecting to nCore!" otherwise), and a 2002 theme has no line for it.
; ==============================================================================
LoadModule $LiteStepDir$Core.dll
*NetLoadModule label-1.99

*nLabel ClassicDemo
ClassicDemoX 100
ClassicDemoY 100
ClassicDemoWidth 420
ClassicDemoHeight 60
ClassicDemoColor #FF202040
ClassicDemoFontColor #FFFFFFFF
ClassicDemoFontSize 16
ClassicDemoText "label-1.99 -> Label.dll"
